  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-203/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.62805
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Live in the body intimately and deeply.",
      "path": "audio/1971-203/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.9958049999999998,
      "end": 4.699841
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Feel the body more and let the body feel more.",
      "path": "audio/1971-203/03.mp3",
      "start": 6.157415,
      "end": 9.266053999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "It is astonishing how many people are almost completely unaware of themselves physically.",
      "path": "audio/1971-203/04.mp3",
      "start": 10.716190000000001,
      "end": 15.963083999999998
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The body is suppressed and denied life too much, that is why it is just a dead weight and not a living joy.",
      "path": "audio/1971-203/05.mp3",
      "start": 17.493990999999998,
      "end": 24.010045
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "That is why I insist: go back into the body and regain the wonderful joy in its movements, sheer movements.",
      "path": "audio/1971-203/06.mp3",
      "start": 25.517550999999997,
      "end": 33.761995
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Make it a meditation and you will be enriched beyond comprehension.",
      "path": "audio/1971-203/07.mp3",
      "start": 35.172902,
      "end": 40.49
    }
  ]
}
